# Copy to .env (git-ignored) and point at your own Spider-Man (PSX, USA) disc image.
# Resolution order everywhere: CLI arg > this env var > drop-in *.chd in the repo root.
#
# No disc image, executable, or game asset is distributed with this repository — supply your own
# legally-obtained copy.
PSXPORT_SPIDERMAN_DISC=/path/to/Spider-Man (USA).chd
